<MainLayout
	title="About | Anticapitalist League Hungary"
	description="An introduction to the Anticapitalist League Hungary, an emerging civic and political initiative."
	lang="en"
>
	<header>
			<h1>About the League</h1>
			<p>
				The Anticapitalist League Hungary is an emerging civic and political initiative
				exploring how social and economic life can be organized around human dignity,
				shared responsibility, and the common good. Its detailed program is still
				taking shape through discussion and collective work.
			</p>
			<p>
				This website is intended as a public record of the League's ideas, essays,
				statements, and community work. We approach society as more than a set of
				economic relations, attending also to ethical questions, human meaning, and
				the bonds that make collective life possible.
			</p>
	</header>
</MainLayout>
